{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4125070/extras/059df69823d380955dc8ffe95dff3687.poster.avif?t=1769173558\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4125070/extras/059df69823d380955dc8ffe95dff3687.webm?t=1769173558\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4125070/extras/059df69823d380955dc8ffe95dff3687.mp4?t=1769173558\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lightweight and Fast runs (10-15 minutes per run)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various of weapons to choose from (ricochet bullets, pass through, mega fireballs, and many more!)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive waves lasting 30 to 90 seconds each and kill off as many Halloween horrors as you can</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Summon various minions or plants to aid you</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meta progressions that change the way you play the game entirely</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Various Build Based on Different Monsters</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4125070/extras/8fcd9398ab306b69a91ab2c5591a96be.poster.avif?t=1769173558\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4125070/extras/8fcd9398ab306b69a91ab2c5591a96be.webm?t=1769173558\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4125070/extras/8fcd9398ab306b69a91ab2c5591a96be.mp4?t=1769173558\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4125070/extras/09cff7981a8c2a9f34c4d9dc42f032d8.poster.avif?t=1769173558\" width=1080 height=608 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4125070/extras/09cff7981a8c2a9f34c4d9dc42f032d8.webm?t=1769173558\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4125070/extras/09cff7981a8c2a9f34c4d9dc42f032d8.mp4?t=1769173558\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from a rotating set of Halloween monster powers like vampires, witches, werewolves, and ghosts, each granting unique abilities that reshape your build every run. Stack and combine these cursed gifts to create powerful synergies, experiment with distinct playstyles, and push deeper into a Halloween-themed roguelike designed for high replayability.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Pumpkin Reaper</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >is a dark fantasy action RPG with Rogue-like elements. Unlike traditional heroes, Jack draws power not for himself\u2014but for the summons, or plants, he commands. Players will summon, upgrade, and strategically empower a variety of monstrous minions to fight through waves of twisted Halloween abominations, uncover forbidden relics, and shatter the control of hell itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4125070/extras/ddcb15e04c1e83c6e5c8201317116952.poster.avif?t=1769173558\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4125070/extras/ddcb15e04c1e83c6e5c8201317116952.webm?t=1769173558\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4125070/extras/ddcb15e04c1e83c6e5c8201317116952.mp4?t=1769173558\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4125070?t=1769173558","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4125070?t=1769173558","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4125070/aa1c1b02b05599160fc883f03082fe5e0fea89fd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769173558","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4125070/aa1c1b02b05599160fc883f03082fe5e0fea89fd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769173558","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4125070/extras/059df69823d380955dc8ffe95dff3687.poster.avif?t=1769173558\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4125070/extras/059df69823d380955dc8ffe95dff3687.webm?t=1769173558\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4125070/extras/059df69823d380955dc8ffe95dff3687.mp4?t=1769173558\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lightweight and Fast runs (10-15 minutes per run)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various of weapons to choose from (ricochet bullets, pass through, mega fireballs, and many more!)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive waves lasting 30 to 90 seconds each and kill off as many Halloween horrors as you can</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Summon various minions or plants to aid you</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meta progressions that change the way you play the game entirely</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Various Build Based on Different Monsters</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4125070/extras/8fcd9398ab306b69a91ab2c5591a96be.poster.avif?t=1769173558\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4125070/extras/8fcd9398ab306b69a91ab2c5591a96be.webm?t=1769173558\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4125070/extras/8fcd9398ab306b69a91ab2c5591a96be.mp4?t=1769173558\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4125070/extras/09cff7981a8c2a9f34c4d9dc42f032d8.poster.avif?t=1769173558\" width=1080 height=608 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4125070/extras/09cff7981a8c2a9f34c4d9dc42f032d8.webm?t=1769173558\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4125070/extras/09cff7981a8c2a9f34c4d9dc42f032d8.mp4?t=1769173558\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from a rotating set of Halloween monster powers like vampires, witches, werewolves, and ghosts, each granting unique abilities that reshape your build every run. Stack and combine these cursed gifts to create powerful synergies, experiment with distinct playstyles, and push deeper into a Halloween-themed roguelike designed for high replayability.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Pumpkin Reaper</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >is a dark fantasy action RPG with Rogue-like elements. Unlike traditional heroes, Jack draws power not for himself\u2014but for the summons, or plants, he commands. Players will summon, upgrade, and strategically empower a variety of monstrous minions to fight through waves of twisted Halloween abominations, uncover forbidden relics, and shatter the control of hell itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4125070/extras/ddcb15e04c1e83c6e5c8201317116952.poster.avif?t=1769173558\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4125070/extras/ddcb15e04c1e83c6e5c8201317116952.webm?t=1769173558\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4125070/extras/ddcb15e04c1e83c6e5c8201317116952.mp4?t=1769173558\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","developers":["Aey and Mel Gaming"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4125070/7812a7eb382616d9f552710f34701b72388d2a9e/header.jpg?t=1769173558","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Apple M-Series or Intel 64 bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M-Series or Intel 64 bit<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong